id: pm-7ipajv
title: Release candidate acceptance hard-codes the pre-bump CLI version and blocks the daily cut
description: "The current-main Auto Release pipeline synchronizes package.json to the date-version candidate before running coverage. The packaged runtime-compatibility acceptance test asserts a literal prior CLI version in stderr, so correct candidate behavior fails the release gate after version synchronization."
type: Issue
status: in_progress
priority: 1
tags[5]: acceptance,"area:release","area:sdk",ci,regression
created_at: "2026-08-08T13:13:00.263Z"
updated_at: "2026-08-08T13:30:47.375Z"
assignee: "harness:codex"
claim_principal: "harness:codex#311a8aed9ab7c477f6e67245"
author: "harness:codex"
estimated_minutes: 60
acceptance_criteria: "The packaged test obtains the executing CLI version rather than embedding a date version; focused and exact 100/100/100/100 coverage gates pass; exact-head PR checks and reviews pass; one v2026.8.8 tag/package is published and verified through npm, npx, and bunx; the failed run and recovery are recorded on the release-health lineage"
goal: project management = context management
objective: Restore candidate-version-independent release acceptance without weakening the runtime warning contract
value: Daily release gates validate behavior across version synchronization instead of encoding yesterday's package metadata
why_now: The first post-merge release is blocked and no 2026.8.8 artifact exists
parent: pm-u9d0
risk: medium
confidence: high
severity: high
environment: GitHub Actions Auto Release run 31258567364 on merged main 589b0d217
repro_steps: Run the release pipeline after candidate version synchronization; coverage fails in tests/unit/sdk/project-runtime-compatibility.spec.ts because stderr reports Running 2026.8.8 while the assertion expects Running 2026.8.7.
expected_result: Packaged acceptance derives the executing CLI version and remains valid before and after the date-version candidate bump; the guarded release completes exactly once.
actual_result: "Auto Release run 31258567364 failed with one assertion after 7,061 passing tests; no tag or package was published."
affected_version: 2026.8.8
component: packaged SDK/CLI runtime compatibility acceptance
regression: true
