comments[4]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-08-08T13:13:00.263Z","harness:codex","Duplicate check: searched all statuses for packaged runtime compatibility, hard-coded CLI version, release candidate, and Auto Release. The permanent pm-7zs0 reminder owns recurring verification, pm-e70zh5 owns reliability-rate measurement, and closed pm-1eted6 owns the delivered feature; none owns this concrete candidate-version test regression. Source: https://github.com/unbraind/pm-cli/actions/runs/31258567364"
  "2026-08-08T13:14:38.560Z","harness:codex","Implementation evidence: packaged acceptance now reads the executing dist CLI version, validates its date-version shape, pins the isolated project to 2099.1.1, and asserts the exact dynamic warning. Focused suite passes 65/65; build, typecheck, lint, and diff checks passed."
  "2026-08-08T13:19:53.454Z","harness:codex","Exact local gate evidence: repository coverage passes 453 files and 7,062 tests at 50,234/50,234 statements, 36,694/36,694 branches, 10,317/10,317 functions, and 48,635/48,635 lines. This is the same post-version-sync gate stage that failed in Auto Release run 31258567364."
  "2026-08-08T13:30:47.375Z","harness:codex","Exact-head PR evidence for #938 at 6c869387794a76c0d5afd6dcc21fe42b54ef17f1: every hosted check passed, including aggregate 100% coverage, four coverage shards, static/smoke/typecheck/compat gates, Linux/macOS/Windows runtime, CodeQL, Semgrep, Trivy, TruffleHog, ShellCheck, PSScriptAnalyzer, CodeFactor, DeepScan, Codecov, and CodSpeed. CodeRabbit completed after one cooldown retry and reported no actionable comments; Sourcery review quota and Cubic were unavailable. Fresh inventory had zero review threads. Bot comments/review were individually reacted to and acknowledged."
